        {
          "text": " Sirikiswamata akirot kere kanuka aŋolopa, karaida eitur atai, dimarai kaitasono ŋinituŋanan kitopoloorite aupake, itia ŋes ilopet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
